<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/31f5152404c8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[9511] Discussing the incident, which resulted in one woman getting beat up, Cosme Lozano, chief of police of Huntington Park, told NBC News that the robot wasn’t yet fully operational, though they didn’t disclose that when they introduced it." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9511" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/36bf993ee627> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1203] Officers from the Huntington Park Police Department cops finally arrived 15 minutes later, after the row had ended." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1203" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e3208a6bb3c9> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1203] But instead of offering assistance, the egg-shaped robot, whose official name is HP RoboCop, barked at Guebara to ‘Step out of the way’." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1203" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7d6bfe505531> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Those features include an emergency alert button, 2-way intercom, the ability to read about 1,200 car license plates a minute, 360-degree high-definition live video stream and the ability to track cell phone use in the vicinity." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9511" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e8a046577810> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The Silicon Valley company says it has combined self-driving technology, robotics and artificial intelligence to create what it calls “crime-fighting autonomous data machines.”" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1154" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2f81a60deb6c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Cogo Guebara was minding her own business in Salt Lake Park when a fight broke out in the parking lot." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1685" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5cc0e7185060> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A robotics company known as SRI International has developed their own take on tech in policing, and if used, it could save lives." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2002" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/60bd2314ed89> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Huntingdon Park police chief Cosme Lozano told NBC." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9513" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/77c60649074a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Officers from the Huntington Park Police Department cops finally arrived 15 minutes later, after the row had ended." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1203" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9fee50d542fc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Neither is a good look for the Huntington Park PD, especially seeing as the robot costs in the region of $70,000 to lease." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1685" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a33004a439f5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Huntington Park, California added a new police officer to its squad; a robot actually named RoboCop." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9514" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a758e969f057> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A report from NBC News said that Cogo Guebara was in Salt Lake Park recently when she noticed two people fighting in the parking lot." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2002" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a8ad7aaca990> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "While another witness, Rudy Espericuta, called the cops the old-fashioned way on his phone, RoboCop carried on its pre-programmed patrol route." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9514" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e4eb4deaa58a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "This anthropomorphizing of the robot is totally normal, said Ross Knepper, an associate professor in the department of computer science at Cornell University." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1154" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f7ee43269596> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Local Police Chief Cosme Lozano says the robots, which cost between $60,000 and $70,000 a year to lease, are still in a trial phase and that their alert buttons have not yet been activated." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1203" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fc98a71cc8cb> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Confirmed Stacey Stephens, the company’s executive vice president and chief client officer." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1154" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fd7f60a99c9d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A witness, Cogo Guebara, saw the fight and immediately approached the robot with \"POLICE\" written across it in massive letters for help." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9514" .

