<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4e793f5b0487> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "“HP RoboCop’s capabilities are extremely impressive,” City Manager Ricardo Reyes said in a statement." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9514" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e9bd9b7a0ecd> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Discussing the incident, which resulted in one woman getting beat up, Cosme Lozano, chief of police of Huntington Park, told NBC News that the robot wasn’t yet fully operational, though they didn’t disclose that when they introduced it." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9511" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/07a66e292e02> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The K5 model, nicknamed HP RoboCop by the department, supposedly has abilities that include a 360-degree HD live video stream, a license plate reader that can scan 1,200 plates a minute, a two-way intercom and the ability to track cell phone use in the vicinity, according to Knightscope." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2002" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/00b0b45f77dd> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Knightscope’s website promotes some of the K5’s abilities as including a 360-degree high-definition live video stream, a license plate reader that can scan 1,200 plates a minute, a two-way intercom and the ability to track cell phone use in the vicinity." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1154" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0ec05d778169> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Any help requests are currently sent to a company called Knightscope, which creates and leases the robots." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1203" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/25cbbee3174b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "These HP RoboCops, built and leased by Knightscope, are not yet linked up to police departments." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2001" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d08561cca200> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Instead, he said, calls go to Knightscope — and will continue to do so until the police department develops protocols for handling calls made through the police bot." ;
